==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Black Slug]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Lucky Dags]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Razorback]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Lucky Dags]] spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**1 [[Gory Groom]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Use cheap meatshields and/or units such as [[Ancient Egg: N103 (Rare Cat)|Gas Mask]]/[[Li'l Gau (Rare Cat)|Li'l Gau]] in this level to stall the enemies, use [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] to then freeze them, and Talented [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T.]] to rush them down quickly.

